@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam titleFontSize 18
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F7FAFC
skinparam classBorderColor #456575
skinparam packageBackgroundColor white
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
hide empty members
title Reservation — chuyển trạng thái bất biến
[*] --> RESERVED : reserve() all-or-nothing
RESERVED --> COMMITTED : commit / onHand-=q; reserved-=q; SALE
RESERVED --> RELEASED : release / reserved-=q
COMMITTED --> [*]
RELEASED --> [*]
note right of COMMITTED
Repeated commit trả trạng thái cũ.
release sau COMMITTED: 409.
end note
note right of RELEASED
Repeated release trả trạng thái cũ.
commit sau RELEASED: 409.
Không auto-expire.
end note
@enduml
